flowchart TD
    A[Request Choices for Current Stage] --> B{Stage Number}
    B -->|1| C[Return Combat Only]
    B -->|2 to 4| D[Create Pool: Combat, Event, Reward, Shop]
    B -->|5| E[Return Boss Combat Only]
    D --> F{Previous Node Was Non-Combat?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Remove Previous Node Type]
    F -->|No| H[Keep Full Pool]
    G --> I[Randomly Select Two Different Types]
    H --> I
    I --> J[Display Two Route Options]
    C --> K[Display One Route Option]
    E --> K
    J --> L[Player Selects a Node]
    K --> L
    L --> M[Store Selected Type and Resolve Node]
    M --> N[Advance Stage After Resolution]
